sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant TaskA as "Task A (Thread Mode, PSP_A)"
    participant Core as "Cortex-M4F Core (ARMv7E-M)"
    participant SysTick as "SysTick_Handler (Handler Mode, MSP, Prio 15)"
    participant PendSV as "PendSV_Handler (Handler Mode, MSP, Prio 15)"
    participant TaskB as "Task B (Thread Mode, PSP_B)"

    TaskA->>Core: Executing user code (CONTROL.SPSEL = 1, using PSP_A)
    Note over SysTick: 1 ms tick fires (or FromISR calls portYIELD_FROM_ISR)
    Core->>Core: Auto-stacks 8 words [R0-R3, R12, LR, PC, xPSR] onto PSP_A (+ Lazy FPU reserve if FPCA=1)
    Core->>SysTick: Enters SysTick_Handler on MSP (LR = EXC_RETURN 0xFFFFFFFD or 0xFFFFFFED)
    SysTick->>SysTick: Increments xTickCount & checks Ready list for higher/equal prio task
    SysTick->>Core: Sets SCB->ICSR.PENDSVSET (defers switch until all higher IRQs complete!)
    SysTick->>Core: Returns via BX LR (tail-chains into PendSV in 6 cycles if no higher IRQ!)

    Core->>PendSV: Enters PendSV_Handler on MSP (lowest priority 15)
    PendSV->>Core: Reads PSP_A via MRS R0, PSP
    PendSV->>Core: Checks EXC_RETURN bit 4 (TST LR, #0x10): if 0, VSTMDBEQ S16-S31 onto PSP_A
    PendSV->>Core: Pushes callee-saved R4-R11 + LR (EXC_RETURN) onto PSP_A
    PendSV->>PendSV: Stores updated R0 into pxCurrentTCB->pxTopOfStack
    PendSV->>PendSV: Raises BASEPRI = configMAX_SYSCALL_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY -> calls vTaskSwitchContext() -> clears BASEPRI
    PendSV->>PendSV: Loads new Task B stack pointer from new pxCurrentTCB->pxTopOfStack into R0
    PendSV->>Core: Pops R4-R11 + LR (EXC_RETURN) from PSP_B; if LR[4]==0, VLDMIAEQ S16-S31
    PendSV->>Core: Updates PSP via MSR PSP, R0 and executes BX LR

    Core->>Core: Hardware auto-unstacks [R0-R3, R12, LR, PC, xPSR] from PSP_B
    Core->>TaskB: Resumes Task B seamlessly in Thread Mode on PSP_B
